    "Net-(U20-Pad13)" "unconnected-(U21A-~{Q}-Pad6)" "unconnected-(U21B-~{Q}-Pad8)" "unconnected-(U21B-Q-Pad9)" "Net-(U23-Pad10)" "Net-(U23-Pad4)" "unconnected-(U24-Q3-Pad11)" "unconnected-(U24-Q2-Pad12)"
